<title>GERMANY: KSB cuts pre-tax losses in nine-mo 1996.</title>
<headline>KSB cuts pre-tax losses in nine-mo 1996.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to end September</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax loss			 9.4     vs 44.8</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,533   vs 1,389</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German pump manufacturing group is KSB AG.</p>
</text>
